#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:245
msgid "Play lossless"
msgstr "Verliesvrij luisteren"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:294
msgid ""
"Spotify plays lossless through Soloist, its own player. On Linux, Spotifast "
"runs it in the background, and this computer stays one device."
msgstr ""
"Spotify speelt verliesvrij via Soloist, zijn eigen speler. Op Linux laat "
"Spotifast hem op de achtergrond draaien, en deze computer blijft één "
"apparaat."

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:299
msgid "1. Get Soloist from Spotify"
msgstr "1. Soloist van Spotify halen"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:303
#, rust-format
msgid "Installed, version {version}"
