msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "Opslaan…"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:391
msgid "Save key"
msgstr "Sleutel opslaan"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:405
msgid "3. Connect it to your account"
msgstr "3. Verbinden met je account"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:411
msgid ""
"Connected. Music on this computer plays through Soloist. The player bar "
"shows the quality Spotify reports."
msgstr ""
"Verbonden. Muziek op deze computer speelt via Soloist. De spelerbalk toont "
"de kwaliteit die Spotify meldt."

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:417
msgid "Waiting for Spotify to pair this receiver…"
msgstr "Wachten tot Spotify deze ontvanger koppelt…"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:424
msgid ""
"Pairing hasn't finished. Check that Spotify uses the same account and local "
"network, select the receiver in Spotify's device picker, then press Check "
"again."
msgstr "Het koppelen is niet voltooid. Controleer of Spotify hetzelfde account en lokale netwerk gebruikt, selecteer de ontvanger in de apparaatkiezer van Spotify en druk op Opnieuw controleren."

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:432
msgid ""
"Start the receiver, then pair it once in Spotify's app. It remembers your "
"account for later starts."
msgstr "Start de ontvanger en koppel deze eenmalig in de Spotify-app. Je account wordt onthouden voor de volgende keren."

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:448
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"In Spotify's app, use the same account and local network as Spotifast. Open "
"the device picker and select {name}."
msgstr "Gebruik in de Spotify-app hetzelfde account en lokale netwerk als in Spotifast. Open de apparaatkiezer en selecteer {name}."

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:454
msgid "Check again"
msgstr "Opnieuw controleren"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:456
msgid "Start receiver"
msgstr "Ontvanger starten"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:470
msgid ""
"Soloist's sound skips Spotifast's equalizer. If Spotify reports less than "
"lossless, set this device's audio quality to Lossless once in Spotify's "
"phone app."
msgstr ""
"Het geluid van Soloist gaat niet door de equalizer van Spotifast. Meldt "
"Spotify minder dan verliesvrij, zet de audiokwaliteit van dit apparaat dan "
"één keer op Verliesvrij in de Spotify-app op je telefoon."

